{"slug":"/students/subjects/physics/mechanics/circular-motion/","source":"students/subjects/physics/mechanics/circular-motion.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Circular Motion | Physics Mechanics","description":"","subject":"physics","body":"<div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n        <nav class=\"mb-8\">\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/mechanics/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700\">← Back to Mechanics</a>\n        </nav>\n\n        <div class=\"content-card rounded-xl p-8\">\n            <header class=\"mb-12\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Circular Motion</h1>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">Understanding motion in a circle and the forces involved</p>\n            </header>\n\n            <div class=\"grid gap-8\">\n                <!-- Basic Concepts -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Basic Concepts</h2>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Key Terms</h3>\n                                <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                    <li>• Radius (r): Distance from center</li>\n                                    <li>• Period (T): Time for one revolution</li>\n                                    <li>• Frequency (f): Revolutions per second</li>\n                                    <li>• Angular velocity (ω): Rate of angle change</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Important Relations</h3>\n                                <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                    <li>• f = 1/T</li>\n                                    <li>• ω = 2π/T = 2πf</li>\n                                    <li>• v = 2πr/T = ωr</li>\n                                    <li>• v = linear velocity</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Uniform Circular Motion -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Uniform Circular Motion</h2>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                        <!-- Characteristics -->\n                        <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Characteristics</h3>\n                            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Motion Properties</h4>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• Constant speed</li>\n                                        <li>• Varying velocity (direction changes)</li>\n                                        <li>• Constant radius</li>\n                                        <li>• Constant angular velocity</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <h4 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Key Features</h4>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• Path is circular</li>\n                                        <li>• Speed remains constant</li>\n                                        <li>• Acceleration toward center</li>\n                                        <li>• Requires centripetal force</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Centripetal Acceleration -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Centripetal Acceleration</h2>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                        <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                                <div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Formula</h3>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• a = v²/r</li>\n                                        <li>• a = ω²r</li>\n                                        <li>• a = 4π²r/T²</li>\n                                        <li>• Always points to center</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                                <div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Properties</h3>\n                                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                        <li>• Causes direction change</li>\n                                        <li>• Magnitude constant</li>\n                                        <li>• Direction changes continuously</li>\n                                        <li>• Required for circular motion</li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Common Examples -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Common Examples</h2>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Natural Motion</h3>\n                                <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                    <li>• Moon around Earth</li>\n                                    <li>• Planets around Sun</li>\n                                    <li>• Electrons around nucleus</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Mechanical Systems</h3>\n                                <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                    <li>• Car turning</li>\n                                    <li>• Merry-go-round</li>\n                                    <li>• Fan blades</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Laboratory</h3>\n                                <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                    <li>• Centrifuge</li>\n                                    <li>• Whirling apparatus</li>\n                                    <li>• Conical pendulum</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Forces in Circular Motion -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Forces Providing Centripetal Acceleration</h2>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Types of Forces</h3>\n                                <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                    <li>• Tension (in string)</li>\n                                    <li>• Friction (on road)</li>\n                                    <li>• Gravity (orbital motion)</li>\n                                    <li>• Normal force (banked roads)</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Force Requirements</h3>\n                                <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                    <li>• F = mv²/r</li>\n                                    <li>• F = mω²r</li>\n                                    <li>• Points to center</li>\n                                    <li>• Must be maintained</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Practice Problems -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Practice Problems</h2>\n                    <div class=\"bg-white/50 rounded-lg p-6\">\n                        <ol class=\"list-decimal pl-6 space-y-4 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium mb-2\">Basic Calculations</p>\n                                <p>A car moves in a circular path of radius 50m at a speed of 10 m/s. Calculate:</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm\">\n                                    <li>Centripetal acceleration</li>\n                                    <li>Time for one complete revolution</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium mb-2\">Minimum Speed</p>\n                                <p>A conical pendulum makes an angle of 30° with the vertical. Find:</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm\">\n                                    <li>Minimum speed needed</li>\n                                    <li>Tension in the string</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>\n                                <p class=\"font-medium mb-2\">Banking of Roads</p>\n                                <p>A circular track of radius 100m is banked at 15°. What is the safe speed to avoid sideways friction?</p>\n                                <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-blue-600\">Hint: Consider normal force components</p>\n                            </li>\n                        </ol>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n        .content-card {\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}